WEBVTT

00:03.800 --> 00:05.200
General.

00:13.560 --> 00:15.680
Marquis of Nan how have you been lately?

00:15.760 --> 00:18.320
Doing well, General inside.

00:23.520 --> 00:29.120
Get up, get up quickly get up and pay respects to General Shilang General I told you these Xuan people.

00:29.200 --> 00:30.600
Are all spineless.

00:33.360 --> 00:37.720
I heard Xuan people are refined and laugh at us as barbarians.

00:38.960 --> 00:43.800
Marquis of Nan could you perform a dance for me to see?

00:49.360 --> 00:53.400
Marquis of Nan performs a dance for the general.

01:22.680 --> 01:25.760
Good good.

01:27.880 --> 01:29.280
Good.

01:32.640 --> 01:34.040
Good.

01:35.880 --> 01:38.280
Give him food tonight.

01:46.640 --> 01:48.040
Good.

01:49.500 --> 02:01.000
In the eighteen years that followed, the aging Prince of Jin, Sikong Yao, endured great hardships to bide his time. At last, he found an opportunity while serving wine to assassinate Wu Jun's Grand Chanyu Ayiji, succeeding in a single strike.

